      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING KRISTOFF (3) has an excellent record here having never missed the placings in three starts, including two wins. Comes off a (29.62) win last time, scoring by 3.5 lengths in a Mix 1/2/3 over 515m at this track. Appeals as a leading chance in this. BIG TOWN TILLY (2) improved her time on first attempt here at the trip with a 0.8 lengths second in 29.75 latest. Should be in this for a long way. PRIM AND PRETTY (1) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (26.47) at Bulli behind Queen Era in a NG. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Expecting another good run. CLASSIC ETHICS (8) was out of the money here last time out but can bounce back.",
